      "text": "angel of God fell from heaven, became devil, 2 Ne. 2:17 (9:8). without resurrection, men’s spirits must become angels to devil, 2 Ne. 9:8–9. Satan transformed himself into angel of light, 2 Ne. 9:9 (Alma 30:53). filthy shall be devil and his angels, 2 Ne. 9:16. loose yourselves from pains of hell that ye become not angels to devil, Jacob 3:11. everlasting fire prepared for devil and his angels, Mosiah 26:27. people will say, We are surrounded by devil’s angels, Hel. 13:37.",
